      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Canandaigua and Niagara Falls Railroad opened a single‑track line through Getzville in 1855, making the hamlet a key stop on the “Peanut Line.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
