      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the 1860s, German farmers settled around Getzville’s mills and crossroads, turning the area into a thriving agricultural community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
