      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/getzville_new_york",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Getzville Fire Company, founded in 1917, still serves as a neighborhood hub, hosting pancake breakfasts and Halloween parties.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
